title: Authorizations › Queue › Read and open a request row
route: /authorizations
intro: What each part of a request row says, which parts are links, and where the status, deadline, next action and chance come from. The clinical scores are not on the row: they are on the case page. Agent activity lines are not shown anywhere; the status chip and 'Next:' carry the fact.
dir: TD
also: The request ID, the small 'Quick view' icon button beside the patient, the 'Open' button and the 'Coverage needs a fix' pill are controls. A click on the rest of the row also opens the quick view. At 1280 px and wider the row is one line; below that the same cells sit on two lines.
---
screen t "Request row\nOne open request inside a band"

group gL "Case and patient"
  process id "'R-1042 · J.M., 34'\nThe ID is a link"
  process pr "'Residential 3.5 · Summit Medicaid HMO · Admission'\nLevel of care, payer, request type"
endgroup

group gS "Status"
  process st "Status chip with its existing name\nPreparing, Ready to sign, With the payer or Denial route"
  decision dR "Has every check passed after actions applied on the case page?"
  process st2 "Chip reads 'Ready to sign' (the filter treats it the same way)"
  decision dN "Needs your input, and not ready?"
  toast pn "Pill 'Needs your input'"
  decision dC "Does coverage need a fix?"
  click cl "Click the 'Coverage needs a fix' pill"
  goto gE "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits › Verify › Ways in and pre-fill"
endgroup

group gD "Deadline and next action"
  process due "Deadline pill, e.g. 'Notice due in 5 h'\nUnder 48 h: 'in 40 min' or 'in 5 h'. Later: 'Decision Thu'. Past: '... now'\nRed dot only in Act now"
  process nx "'Next: Name the step-down provider'\nThe first open recommended action, or 'Review the draft, then sign and send it' when every check passes"
  decision dK "Is it already with the payer, or a denial?"
  process nx2 "'Next: Wait for Cardinal to decide', 'Next: Review the brief and make the peer-to-peer call', or the payer's own next step"
endgroup

group gC "Approval chance"
  process ch "One number in its band colour\n'62%' with the word under it: Strong 80+, Moderate 55–79, At risk below 55\nNo bar"
  decision dA "Were actions applied on the case page?"
  process ch2 "The number is the new chance"
  process ch3 "The number is the request's own chance"
endgroup

process tint "Rows in Act now have a red tint\nOther bands are neutral"
doc off "Not on the row\nScores (AUDIT-C, PHQ-9, CIWA ...)\nThey are in the case page's diagnosis line"

click idl "Click the request ID (underlined)"
click ob "Click 'Open'"
click qv "Click the 'Quick view' icon button (aria-label 'Quick view R-1042')\nor click the row away from a link or a button"
process ring "The row whose quick view is open has a green outline"
goto gQ "Continues in: Authorizations › Queue › Quick view panel"
goto gC2 "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Ways in"
goto gX "Continues in: Authorizations › Case page › Next action"

t --> id --> pr
t --> st --> dR
dR -->|Yes| st2 --> dN
dR -->|No| dN
dN -->|Yes| pn --> dC
dN -->|No| dC
dC -->|Yes| cl --> gE
t --> due --> nx --> dK
dK -->|Yes| nx2
nx -.-> gX
t --> ch --> dA
dA -->|Yes| ch2
dA -->|No| ch3
t --> tint
t -.-> off
t --> idl --> gC2
t --> ob --> gC2
t --> qv --> ring --> gQ
